  <string name="night_sleep_score_formula">The score combines sleep efficiency, wake after sleep onset, awakenings per hour of sleep, time to fall asleep and the deep and REM share of sleep. Each component is scaled from 0 to 100 where a higher value is better. Missing components are removed and the remaining weights are renormalized; there is no target sleep duration.</string>
