  <string name="night_sleep_stages_info">Each epoch of the recording is scored as Awake, REM, Light or Deep by the method, or left Unscored when it cannot be scored. The chart places the stages in time, the bar shows the whole recording and the list gives the time spent in each stage.</string>
  <string name="night_heart_rate_info">The mean heart rate of every epoch of the recording. A gap is an epoch without a valid sample; the lowest and the highest value come from the samples themselves.</string>
  <string name="night_movement_info">Movement comes from the tracker\'s accelerometer. The index is the share of epochs that moved more than the method\'s threshold.</string>
